  TITLE     PRSS23 knockdown inhibits gastric tumorigenesis through EIF2
            signaling
  JOURNAL   Pharmacol Res 142, 50-57 (2019)
   PUBMED   30769097
  REMARK    GeneRIF: PRSS23 knockdown could suppress tumor growth of gastric
            cancer in vitro and in vivo through inhibiting EIF2 signaling, and
            EIF4E maybe a potential target of PRSS23. PRSS23 could serve as a
            potential target for gastric cancer therapy, and also a biomarker
            for the prediction of prognosis of gastric cancer.
